atives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af36-76d7-b3a9-3b5091533fc1","description":"Di\u00f3xido de carbono","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7643-bec6-2b75c8ff46c4","description":"Nitrog\u00eanio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7dd0-a15a-31134926d4f2","description":"Oxig\u00eanio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-78fb-87b7-6ce2cd9e1c05","description":"Metano","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7391-8c1c-521178416bc7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a paleoantropologia estuda?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A paleoantropologia utiliza f\u00f3sseis e evid\u00eancias arqueol\u00f3gicas para tra\u00e7ar a evolu\u00e7\u00e3o dos homin\u00eddeos ao longo do tempo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7b05-a437-634f8d13cb8d","description":"povos pr\u00e9-hist\u00f3ricos e as origens do ser humano","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7294-bc1f-7a0ed8994f38","description":"intera\u00e7\u00f5es entre organismos e processos geomorfol\u00f3gicos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7cc7-98fa-8e83c717479c","description":"estudo de res\u00edduos e lixo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7240-a90f-82c9de0cf06b","description":"crime","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-75c2-9dcc-89e04b5ffac0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que tipo de material \u00e9 o solo franco?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O solo franco \u00e9 um tipo de terra, geralmente uma mistura f\u00e9rtil de areia, silte e argila que favorece o crescimento das plantas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7c5d-83c3-e68653b94a7f","description":"Terra","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-735c-a486-05e63e815337","description":"Madeira","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7f2f-9aca-430bba962b42","description":"Metal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7ba7-a8ee-1187a4f61d42","description":"Rocha","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af36-7bf0-af2c-c92