n":"A gravidade atrai as part\u00edculas atmosf\u00e9ricas em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Terra, impedindo que a maioria seja levada para o espa\u00e7o; a mesma for\u00e7a rege as \u00f3rbitas planet\u00e1rias.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-76f3-8496-162e3fdd7051","description":"Gravidade","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7282-bae4-bbaeacd6e098","description":"Atrito","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7337-a5c1-6622a659ef43","description":"For\u00e7a de Coriolis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-709d-adaf-6f11904db020","description":"Efeito solo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-73ef-801b-6ebb4de8b948","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome da grande gal\u00e1xia espiral mais pr\u00f3xima da nossa gal\u00e1xia?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A Gal\u00e1xia de Andr\u00f4meda est\u00e1 se movendo em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Via L\u00e1ctea e espera-se que se funda com ela em um futuro distante.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-736a-a0e6-3a634b862225","description":"Andr\u00f4meda","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7d85-b7e2-a644f0bed788","description":"H\u00e9rcules","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-70bf-8765-352bb3acbba8","description":"Ursa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7a76-86c9-95ef6edfe0e2","description":"\u00d3rion","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7bab-808a-62a79add30e5","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para prevenir qual doen\u00e7a a Marinha Brit\u00e2nica come\u00e7ou a distribuir ra\u00e7\u00f5es di\u00e1rias de suco de lim\u00e3o em 1795?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O escorbuto \u00e9 causado por uma grave defici\u00eancia de vitamina C e pode levar a sangramento nas gengivas e dificuldade na cicatriza\u00e7\u00e3o de feridas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7168-9dde-4421c7ee395f","description":"Escorbuto","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7d42-be86-dce5d02718aa","description":"Var\u00edola","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7eb3-94e6-e7d01dd3798e","description":"Mal\u00e1ria","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-798a-b5e6-9a4d1583c1ee","description":"Febre amarela","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-706e-9f4f-49ac49c10652","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual cientista realizou um teste p\u00fablico de uma vacina contra o antraz em um rebanho de ovelhas em 1881?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"O teste de Louis Pasteur demonstrou a efic\u00e1cia da vacina: as ovelhas vacinadas sobreviveram \u00e0 exposi\u00e7\u00e3o ao antraz, enquanto as n\u00e3o vacinadas morreram.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-76b6-becd-d369b42dd7d4","description":"Louis Pasteur","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7234-9629-529657c9dd8b","description":"Robert Koch","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-70a7-b23b-5290facdbf47","description":"Edward Jenner","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-77e5-b5a1-d99fa6916964","description":"Alexander Fleming","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-726c-b1c7-a437fa2be057","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome dado ao \u00fanico supercontinente que existia h\u00e1 200 milh\u00f5es de anos?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"A Pangeia come\u00e7ou a se fragmentar \u00e0 medida que as placas tect\u00f4nicas se deslocavam, acabando por se separar nos continentes que conhecemos hoje.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-710e-90ff-dd8c9958078c","description":"Pangeia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-71de-b131-91e8ee2c14a0","description":"Laur\u00e1sia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7915-a542-ce341bd7be2a","description":"Rod\u00ednia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7c80-9ddb-edf3b6474815","description":"Gondwana","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-72b6-9605-e06dded2e6fd","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama um veneno que atua no sistema nervoso?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"As neurotoxinas afetam as c\u00e9lulas nervosas ou sua transmiss\u00e3o de sinais. A toxina botul\u00ednica \u00e9 um exemplo; ela interrompe a comunica\u00e7\u00e3o entre os nervos e os m\u00fasculos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7944-a3f7-e75db6917372","description":"Neurotoxinas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7fcd-b8ef-091aadfa8660","description":"Neurovenenos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7a20-b4de-32aadbad1e31","description":"Endotoxinas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7f05-b5d7-080009afdd20","description":"Endovenomas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7ecb-9b51-81fb2340b496","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quais part\u00edculas s\u00e3o emitidas pelos tubos de raios cat\u00f3dicos?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Os raios cat\u00f3dicos s\u00e3o feixes de el\u00e9trons; os estudos de J. J. Thomson sobre eles ajudaram a estabelecer que os \u00e1tomos cont\u00eam essas part\u00edculas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7d77-a3ba-05742021bc1c","description":"El\u00e9trons","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7827-87f1-ec0cacd9e478","description":"\u00cdons","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7120-8434-6b4e34937d8c","description":"N\u00eautrons","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7213-aee5-085be59296d0","description":"B\u00f3sons","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-753d-a35c-80b2673bf11e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um veado macho?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"\u201cBuck\u201d tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 o termo comum para um coelho macho adulto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-73aa-9c98-641bfefde578","description":"Um buck","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-78b8-bb61-1775af80f47a","description":"Um macho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7465-b732-21a