201cmolly\u201d, e a macho, de \u201cjohn\u201d ou \u201cjack\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7068-b48d-e095e7a5f19d","description":"Uma molly","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7337-b264-8f7e0f5df8a0","description":"Uma vaca","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7706-b210-bb8b9210e0b2","description":"Uma porca","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-78d6-bcdf-daafe0d0a11f","description":"Uma galinha","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-775b-bbaa-7b0347aea72c","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que tipo de forno Percy Spencer inventou depois que um magnetr\u00e3o derreteu sua barra de chocolate?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Um forno de micro-ondas aquece os alimentos fazendo com que as mol\u00e9culas de \u00e1gua vibrem. A descoberta de Spencer surgiu a partir de seu trabalho com magnetronos usados em equipamentos de radar.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-78eb-ae53-29993b3c4473","description":"Um micro-ondas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7fea-be52-4ddff0535cc2","description":"Um forno el\u00e9trico","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7def-8929-81dd14fa02c3","description":"Um forno de convec\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-70ca-8e19-45832f94414a","description":"Uma panela el\u00e9trica","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7fd1-9d6a-a738d5b63c16","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama um gato macho?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Um \u201ctom\u201d \u00e9 um gato macho; o termo \u00e9 frequentemente usado, especialmente para se referir a um que n\u00e3o foi castrado.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7983-bab2-65c5ca5b5adc","description":"Um \u201ctom\u201d","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-71b4-8cd6-d29e76db48ee","description":"Um galo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af37-7cf4-a727-32c016c697fe","description":"Um javali","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3